    "description": "Complete played soprano, written pitches/onsets/durations and eighth-note pickup. Flute73 matches the actual Z80 player example; violin40 and cello42 follow the written Alto/Bass pitches sampled at dotted-quarter boundaries. Clarinet71 Tenor is omitted to fit three tonal oscillators. No invented guitar or percussion. The original two-staff MIDI has no ProgramChange; the actual Z80 four-channel example explicitly sets flute/violin/clarinet/cello. Final LilyPond s8 layout spacer is omitted so the 2.5-beat closing bar and 0.5-beat pickup loop in 6/8."
